        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/af2b276bf4ee7c51c283a785e9df88d9.avif?t=1771487158\" width=391 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noble lord brings two squires along on a hunt. One is a gentle boy who should not exist. The other is a girl who dreams of plunging a dagger into her master’s heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trail of Stars</i> is a short, bittersweet visual novel about two vulnerable souls navigating first love, growing up, and protecting what they have—when all they have is each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/0372d41f5246a82272bd67a08b481c7c.poster.avif?t=1771487158\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/0372d41f5246a82272bd67a08b481c7c.webm?t=1771487158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/0372d41f5246a82272bd67a08b481c7c.mp4?t=1771487158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/92dffca653fcc700a661156fa8e18fa4.avif?t=1771487158\" width=462 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short and (bitter)sweet tale</strong>, under 3k words with two endings. A moving story you can finish in one sitting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful hand-drawn artwork</strong>. Watch the scenes unfold through storybook-inspired visuals and three detailed ending illustrations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An emotional original score</strong> featuring cello performances by ArcanaXIX. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One knightly kiss on the hand</strong>. A must for fans of tender romances and stories featuring childhood friends to lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/a88b0ae06bd6e155e80ae3d2579da70c.webp?t=1771487158\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/a88b0ae06bd6e155e80ae3d2579da70c.poster.avif?t=1771487158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=655 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/e596aded4b8d49fe1934f0bf25adbd99.avif?t=1771487158\" width=424 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story, programming, GUI, logo design, project direction: ENDYSIS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character art, cover illustration: Pauline Reinacher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background art: Sparrowling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG illustrations: Akua</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: ENDYSIS, Calamanser, ArcanaXIX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient SFX: Calamanser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cello performances: ArcanaXIX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in one month for Sealed with a Kiss Jam (2025).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/d4e414eedd97a193ef61d1e994a0eb06.avif?t=1771487158\" width=436 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See more of this world (and the characters many years in the future) in my upcoming game <i>The Last Winter Knight.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/c9cb8ee272d24b5bce4200a98fec296c.avif?t=1771487158\" width=1440 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/af2b276bf4ee7c51c283a785e9df88d9.avif?t=1771487158\" width=391 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noble lord brings two squires along on a hunt. One is a gentle boy who should not exist. The other is a girl who dreams of plunging a dagger into her master’s heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trail of Stars</i> is a short, bittersweet visual novel about two vulnerable souls navigating first love, growing up, and protecting what they have—when all they have is each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/0372d41f5246a82272bd67a08b481c7c.poster.avif?t=1771487158\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/0372d41f5246a82272bd67a08b481c7c.webm?t=1771487158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/0372d41f5246a82272bd67a08b481c7c.mp4?t=1771487158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/92dffca653fcc700a661156fa8e18fa4.avif?t=1771487158\" width=462 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short and (bitter)sweet tale</strong>, under 3k words with two endings. A moving story you can finish in one sitting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful hand-drawn artwork</strong>. Watch the scenes unfold through storybook-inspired visuals