lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See more of this world (and the characters many years in the future) in my upcoming game <i>The Last Winter Knight.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006140/extras/c9cb8ee272d24b5bce4200a98fec296c.avif?t=1771487158\" width=1440 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
